## 0.9.0 — Proposal 09 — CoreWidgets — 053126
Agent: Claude Sonnet 4.6

Added four composable rendering helpers to deskapp/src/widgets.py,
exported from the top-level deskapp package. No curses imports — all
rendering routes through Module.write().

ScrollList: stateful scrollable list. SetItems(), MoveUp/Down/JumpTop/
JumpEnd(), Selected(), SelectedIndex(), Render(Mod, Panel, Row, Col,
Height, Width, SelectedColor, NormalColor, Formatter). Windowing handled
automatically via ScrollTop clamping.

ResultGrid: column-auto-sized tabular grid. SetData(Cols, Rows), vertical
and horizontal scroll (HScroll is a column-index offset, whole columns
pan left/right). Header row in cyan, selected row in yellow, row-number
gutter on the left. Works with tuples, lists, or sqlite3.Row.

ConfirmPrompt: inline Y/N prompt. Ask(Message, OnYes, OnNo) arms it;
Yes()/No() fire the stored callable and deactivate; Render() is a no-op
when not Active. Zero curses references.

JsonRegistry: atomic JSON load/save for path lists. Add() deduplicates,
Remove() filters by resolved path, Save() writes via mkstemp+rename.

deskapp/__init__.py — exports ScrollList, ResultGrid, ConfirmPrompt,
JsonRegistry. examples/ex_widgets.py — standalone demo exercising all
four widgets in a single module.

Previously filed proposals 09 (DbBrowser) and 10 (FileBrowser) demoted
to TODO_DbBrowser.prop and TODO_FileBrowser.prop; both will be promoted
and numbered when executed so version stays in sync with built work.

